sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"美国法官驳回Gemini撤销500万美元和解协议的请求，尽管CFTC支持","summary":"美国联邦法官Alvin Hellerstein驳回Gemini与CFTC联合提出的撤销500万美元和解协议的请求，裁定CFTC立场转变不足以推翻2025年1月的和解。Gemini已支付该笔款项，且仍受法院命令约束，不得误导CFTC或公开否认和解认定。法官指出华盛顿对加密监管的友好态度不具追溯力，不会自动抹去既有判决。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/16/u-s-judge-rejects-gemini-s-appeal-to-void-usd5-million-settlement-despite-cftc-backing","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T09:36:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":6,"citationId":"qy3vzw3cxwmlkbq9dhttft5su"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"布伦特原油因中东局势升级触及110美元五个月高点","summary":"布伦特原油价格跳涨至110美元，创五个月新高，此前有报道称沙特领导的部队拦截并摧毁了瞄准关键能源枢纽的导弹。","sourceName":"Financial Times","sourceUrl":"https://www.ft.com/content/8ee22d89-03eb-48dc-99a5-27555373a89c?syn-25a6b1a6=1","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T22:57:43.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"dktnsd9gomrn2nqxudlhfkbge"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普称不会对伊朗使用核武器或派遣地面部队","summary":"美国总统特朗普在Newsmax采访中表示，不打算对伊朗使用核武器，也不预见派遣地面部队。此前CNN报道美军已制定针对伊朗能源基础设施和核设施的新打击计划。英国海事贸易行动组织称霍尔木兹海峡自10月11日以来已发生8次袭击，新加坡籍集装箱船GFS Pride被击中后起火沉没。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/16/us-iran-war-trump-hormuz.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T07:56:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"elkrtaxzwzlsj0r2i2grmnb9z"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, 