77f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"CoreWeave会引爆美国垃圾债市场吗？下一个风险点是甲骨文","summary":"CoreWeave债券收益率飙至16%，五年期CDS隐含违约概率达63%，其租金支撑着高收益市场141亿美元数据中心债券的偿付能力。德意志银行警告甲骨文CDS两日飙升36基点至288基点，BBB评级若遭下调将触发机构强制抛售，危机或从垃圾债蔓延至投资级市场腹地。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783754","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:05.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"juq2d4wzzkudkx7692neoguvz"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"港交所拟于2028年9月将港股结算周期缩短至T+1","summary":"香港交易所发布咨询总结，拟将港股现货市场结算周期由T+2缩短至T+1。实施时间表已修订至2028年下半年，目标日期为2028年9月，证监会表示欢迎。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a14430-f4b3-7468-83da-c15f3109dc0b","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T10:10:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"videy6uqfdmdhyvcwyob9e0r9"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"贝莱德第三季度AUM达15.49万亿美元，相当于美国GDP一半","summary":"贝莱德第三季度资产管理规模达15.49万亿美元，刷新历史纪录，相当于美国全年名义GDP的一半。当季净流入2050亿美元，营收同比增长19%至77.5亿美元，iShares ETF产品线净吸金近1350亿美元。私募信贷业务净流入环比增加50亿美元，企业贷款基金赎回申请占比从13.3%降至约11.5%。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783747","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T02:17:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"kf9t1s0rh760rq2f20o7ap8zf"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Anthropic 信用评级首曝光：BB+，仅比投资级低一档","summary":"据英国《金融时报》获得的文件显示，KBRA 于今年6月授予 Anthropic BB+ 发行人评级，比投资级低一档。该评级针对其350亿美元芯片融资包中约44亿美元的次级债务，这部分以约8.5%的收益率发行，其余由博通担保。评级是在自由现金流和 EBITDA 等关键指标未披露、分析师依赖假设估算的情况下做出的。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783771","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T06:47:27.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"kzeadwnfo3ffgn2irp9o8kzbn"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美联储主席沃什：10月或按兵不动，12月加息预期升温，宣布放弃前瞻指引","summary":"美联储主席沃什在IMF与世界银行年会暗示10月28日会议大概率按兵不动，市场对10月加息押注从约27%降至约15%，主流预期转为10月维持利率不变、12月再加息25个基点。他同时宣布放弃前瞻指引策略，回归数据驱动的决策模式。沃什称AI是他一生中最深远的经济变革，短期推升通胀、长期带来供给侧红利，美联储将于11月16日举行AI经济影响听证会。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783763","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T06:38:33.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"yrmfosueadchl8s7ztyk8r970"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Circle 2026年上半年营收约14亿美元，8.19亿美元支付给分销合作伙伴","summary":"Circle首席商务官Kash Razzaghi披露2026年上半年营收约14亿美元，其中8.19亿美元（约59%）支付给USDC分销合作伙伴及交易成本，4.73亿美元（约34%）用于基础设施投入，净利润率约7%。Circle同时宣布使用CPN或Circle平台的客户可全天候免费近实时赎回USDC，上半年USDC链上结算量超36万亿美元，6月占全球稳定币交易量约77%。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a144b5-32c2-710b-9a6e-6e894776fd8b","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T12:34:48.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"eu1znxnixiwzxfw1lj5jbhwzf"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美联储官员放鹰：Daly称供应冲击不应再'静观其变'，Hammack称通胀预期固化或需更激进加息","summary":"周三美国CPI数据超预期后，旧金山联储主席Mary Daly和克利夫兰联储主席Beth Hammack周四相继释放鹰派信号。Daly称通胀风险已全面偏向上行，不再认为供给冲击会自行消散；Hammack警告若通胀预期固化，美联储或需更激进加息。市场正关注美联储主席沃什周四晚间讲话，本周数据已令月底议息会议加息概率被重新评估。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783737","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T22:55:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"k5yc0mkp4hp67vn973sqch1kq"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美众议院两党议案拟撤销俄柴油豁免并扩大制裁，布伦特原油盘中涨超3%","summary":"美国众议院外交事务委员会民主党首席委员Gregory Meeks提出两党议案《禁止腐败的俄罗斯石油交易法》，拟撤销财政部对俄能源相关的一般许可、禁止未来发放豁免，并要求30天内对参与俄油气开采、炼制及海上运输的主体实施制裁。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783812","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T18:12:40.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"oxrfn8jhaosj9jaszx7go9b5v"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"长鑫科技预计2026年前三季度净利润1310-1325亿元，同比扭亏为盈","summary":"长鑫科技公告预计2026年前三季度营业收入约2650亿至2700亿元，净利润1310亿至1325亿元，较上年同期亏损52.8亿元实现扭亏为盈。公司表示受AI算力需求增长和DRAM行业景气度提升影响，产品供不应求、价格大幅上涨。此外董事长朱一明提议以10亿至20亿元回购公司股份，用于员工股权激励、员工持股计划或减少注册资本。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2296893","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T13:52:06.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"t0qrc7kslflebj2e4evrb4zei"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"黄仁勋回应AI算力需求误读：仅约四分之一到三分之一来自前沿实验室，力挺CoreWeave","summary":"全球科技股市值单周蒸发逾1万亿美元，英伟达CEO黄仁勋公开为CoreWeave背书并称其资本成本正在下降，CoreWeave当日收涨5.94%。他在BG2播客中将算力需求拆解为三部分，前沿实验室仅占约四分之一到三分之一，另有约三分之一来自与AI无关的基础计算，其余来自数千家租用算力的初创公司。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783749","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T02:00:09.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"c4qnp8ikxtclwwitt4vpq9b2x"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"万事达卡与BVNK推出Global Money Platform，整合法币与稳定币支付","summary":"万事达卡与BVNK联合推出Mastercard Global Money Platform，通过单一API整合万事达卡全球支付能力与BVNK稳定币基础设施，这是万事达卡8月完成收购BVNK后双方首个重大整合。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a14466-97c6-73dd-868e-4ac62ccfedea","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T11:08:56.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"qf9czndmvo9wzps84yrfvbllg"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":10,"firstPartyEvents":10},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-17","next":"2026-10-19"}